## Interface: 16001
## Title: Auto Sort Forever
## Notes: Automatically sorts your bags about a second after any change to your own bags (looting, selling, moving items, changing gear), waits while an interaction menu is open, and sorts the bank when the banker opens. Commands: /asf status, /asf on|off, /asf delay <seconds>, /asf menu on|off, /asf bank on|off.
